            "sid": "JER 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wamuambira Jeremia hivi, “Phiya kpwa mfinyangi wa miyo ya ulongo ukagule tupa ya kutiira madzi. Hala seemu ya nyo vilongozi a atu na seemu ya nyo akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Afalume 23:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.30+JER.7.31+JER.7.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jeremia 7:30–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.32.34+JER.32.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:34–35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha tuluka uphiye Dete ra mwana wa Hinomu phephi na phatu pha kuinjirira kutsupira ryango ra madzaya, kuko ukatangaze ndigokuambira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Undaamba, ‘Mwi afalume a Juda na mwi msagalao Jerusalemu phundzani vyo ye Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Iziraeli aambavyo: Lolani, nareha uyi phatu hipha hata atu ndiosikira akakamwe ni miri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nyo atu akaniricha na kunajisi phatu hipha kpwa kufukizira uvumba milungu yanjina ambayo nyo enye, akare aho wala afalume a Juda taimanya. Piya akaphaodzaza phatu hipha na mlatso wa atu asio na makosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao akadzenga mwahali mwa dzulu mwa kulavira sadaka vizuka vya Baali, ili alavye ana aho a chilume na a chichetu dza sadaka za kuochwa, utu ambao siyaalagiza wala kuaamuru, sigaazire tse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba: Lola, siku ziredza ambapho atu taandaiha tsona phatu phapha Tofethi, ama Dete ra mwana wa Hinomu ela phandaihwa dete ra kuolagira atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ndabananga mipango ya atu a Juda na a Jerusalemu nami ndahenda atu aho aolagbwe na upanga ni maadui gao. Nindaatiya mikononi mwa nyo aendzao uhai wao, na nyufu zao zindakala chakurya cha nyama a mapha na nyama a tsakani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ndauhenda mudzi uhu mkpwulu ukale wa kuangalaza na wa kuberwa. Yeyesi ndiyetsupa phephi na phapho andaangalala na kuuzemerera kpwa sababu ya mapigoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaahenda arye ana aho alume na achetu, chisha arye majirani gao wakati wa tabu ndiyosababishwa ni maadui gao arioazangira, alondao kuaangamiza.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chisha undavundza yo simikiro mbere za nyo atu uphiyao nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe undaambira hivi ambavyo mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi naamba: Hivi ndivyo ndivyovundza mudzi uhu na nyo asagalao mumo dza mutu avundzavyo nyungu hata isiweze kufinyangbwa luphya, na atu andazikana Tofethi mana taphandakala na nafwasi phatu phanjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivi ndivyo ndivyohendera mudzi uhu na atue. Mimi ndauhenda mudzi uhu ukale dza Tofethi mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumba za Jerusalemu na madzumba ga afalume a Juda, yani nyumba zosi ambazo dzuluye atu afukizira uvumba vitu vyosi virivyo dzulu mlunguni na kumwaga sadaka za uchi milungu yanjina, vyosi vindakala najisi dza Tofethi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jeremia wauka Tofethi ambako kala akahumwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwendalavya unabii. Achendaima muhala wa nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu, achiambira atu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Iziraeli anaamba hivi, ‘Lolani nindaahendera atu a mudzi uhu mkpwulu na vidzidzivye chila aina ya mashaka nrigopanga chinyume chao, kpwa kukala ni atu visoto asiomendza kuniphundza.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
